Subject: [202605] Complete AS7726 PSU health and CPU thermal inventory

Expose both PSU voltage limits and hardware OT_WARN_LIMIT (0x51). Map the
observed FSF019 F2B* label to EXHAUST; retain the target branch fan-conversion
format. Exclude only unsupported PSU fan target comparisons. Append CPU
package/core sensors using kernel labels and thresholds after board sensors.

